#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Standard frontend bridge (mjwshared)"
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Enable the standard HelloAsso frontend integration based on CRM.payment and "
"mjwshared."
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Secure handling of failure and cancellation URLs"
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Avoid redirecting users to fragile CiviCRM or AJAX URLs when a payment is "
"cancelled or fails."
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Webhook processing queue"
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Place HelloAsso webhooks in the PaymentprocessorWebhook queue instead of "
"processing them immediately."
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Payment status reliability for automations (T+5 / T+15 / T+45 min)"
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Enable automatic checks at T+5, T+15 and T+45 after creation of a HelloAsso "
"checkout. The final check expires an unpaid installment plan or marks a "
"classic checkout as abandoned while keeping its contribution pending for "
"cart reminders. Long-term monitoring of later changes, including refunds, "
"remains independent."
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Afform / Form Builder integration"
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Publish a HelloAsso Checkout Option for Afform / Form Builder based on the "
"CiviCRM core checkout mechanism."
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Enable HelloAsso refunds"
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Allow CiviCRM users with refund permissions to request full HelloAsso "
"refunds from the payment refund screen. Refunds require the HelloAsso "
"authorization-screen mode. HelloAsso partial refunds remain unsupported by "
"this integration."
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Enable HelloAsso installment payments"
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Allow finite monthly installment checkout payloads for HelloAsso payment "
"processors."
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "HelloAsso redirect message on standard forms"
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Message displayed on standard contribution and event forms when the selected"
" payment processor is HelloAsso."
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Enable HelloAsso SEPA direct debit"
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Offer SEPA direct debit on HelloAsso Checkout, including installment "
"checkouts. HelloAsso only displays it for eligible organizations and may "
"keep card payment available."
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Maximum processing batch size (Cron)"
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Maximum number of HelloAsso contributions processed per payment processor "
"during a normal cron execution."
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Strict legacy signature verification"
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Reject HelloAsso webhooks whose legacy invoiceID/sig signature is missing or"
" invalid."
msgstr ""

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
